	"The encoder output resolution (Pn281) is outside the setting range and does not satisfy the setting conditions.",	" Check Pn281.",	" Set Pn281 to an appropriate value.",
A.042,	"Parameter Combination Error",
	"Occurred when the power was turned ON after having changed the electronic gear ratio (Pn20E/Pn210) or the servomotor to one with a different number of encoder pulses.",	"Check if the detection conditions are satisfied: Pn533[min-1]*2^Encoder-resolution/6*10^5<=Pn20E/Pn210, or Max Motor Speer[min-1]*Encoder-resolution/About3.66*10^12>=Pn20E/Pn210",	" Reduce the electronic gear ratio (Pn20E/Pn210).",
	"Occurred when the power was turned ON after having changed the electronic gear ratio (Pn20E/Pn210) or the servomotor to one with a different number of encoder pulses.",	"Either of condition must be satisfied.Pn585 / Linear scale pitch [um])*(Number of divisions of serial converter unit/10)<=Pn20E/Pn210.Pn385 /Linear scale pitch [um])*(Number of divisions of serial converter unit/About 6.10*10^5)>=Pn20E/Pn210.",	" Reduce the electronic gear ratio (Pn20E/Pn210).",
	"Occurred after having changed the setting of the program JOG movement speed (Pn585)",	"Either of condition must be satisfied.Pn585 / Linear scale pitch [um])*(Number of divisions of serial converter unit/10)<=Pn20E/Pn210.Pn385 /Linear scale pitch [um])*(Number of divisions of serial converter unit/About 6.10*10^5)>=Pn20E/Pn210.",	"Increase the setting for program JOG movement speed (Pn585).",
	"Occurred after having changed the setting of the program JOG movement speed (Pn533)",	" Check if the detection conditions are satisfied: Pn533[min-1]*2^Encoder-resolution/6*10^5<=Pn20E/Pn210, or Max Motor Speer[min-1]*Encoder-resolution/About3.66*10^12>=Pn20E/Pn210",	"Increase the setting for program JOG movement speed (Pn533).",
	"Occurred when the power was turned ON to carry out advanced autotuning (Fn017) after having changed the electronic gear ratio (Pn20E/Pn210) or the servomotor to one with a different number of encoder pulses.",	"Either of condition must be satisfied.Pn585 / Linear scale pitch [um])*(Number of divisions of serial converter unit/10)<=Pn20E/Pn210.Pn385 /Linear scale pitch [um])*(Number of divisions of serial converter unit/About 6.10*10^5)>=Pn20E/Pn210.",	" Reduce the electronic gear ratio (Pn20E/Pn210).",
	"Occurred when the power was turned ON to carry out advanced autotuning (Fn017) after having changed the electronic gear ratio (Pn20E/Pn210) or the servomotor to one with a different number of encoder pulses.",	"Check if the detection conditions are satisfied: Pn533[min-1]*2^Encoder-resolution/6*10^5<=Pn20E/Pn210, or Max Motor Speer[min-1]*Encoder-resolution/About3.66*10^12>=Pn20E/Pn210",	"Reduce the electronic gear ratio (Pn20E/Pn210).",
