	"The regenerative resistor disconnected when Servopack power voltage was increased.",	"Measure the resistance of the regenerative resistor.",	"When using the regenerative resistor built in the Servopack:Repair or replace the Servopack. When using a external regenerative resistor:Replace the external regenerative resistor.",
	"In the AC power input mode, DC power was supplied.",	"Check the power supply to see if it is a DC power supply.",	"Correct the setting to match the actual power supply specifications.",
	"In the DC power input mode, AC power was supplied.",	"Check the power supply to see if it is an AC power supply.",	"Correct the setting to match the actual power supply specifications.",
